    {
      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "b1bec0fdbae47b52",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"Distributed once so far. I expect the petition to be denied without further relists. The United States is already a party (as respondent), so a CVSG is essentially out of the question as the Solicitor General will present the government's views directly. If granted, the Court would likely take the first two QPs to resolve the circuit split on the applicability of the totality-of-the-circumstances framework to 18 U.S.C. \\u00a7 242 prosecutions and clarify the mens rea requirements un",
